  "title": "Butter Pound Cake",
  "description": "Cream, lemon extract and a few pantry staples are all you need to make this rich pound cake recipe. Simply delicious served with fruit and ice cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Diana Moore"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-03-21T10:40:57-05:00",
